1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,697
Meet your Gemi.

2
00:00:01,747 --> 00:00:04,687
It exists because you met it.

3
00:00:05,130 --> 00:00:08,599
A small you, living on your campus.

4
00:00:09,060 --> 00:00:10,722
Your day has limits.

5
00:00:10,772 --> 00:00:12,091
So does its day.

6
00:00:12,141 --> 00:00:14,658
It has to choose what matters.

7
00:00:15,130 --> 00:00:16,835
Ask in any language.

8
00:00:16,885 --> 00:00:19,293
It brings back three things.

9
00:00:19,760 --> 00:00:23,877
Every detail is checked against its source, or not shown.

10
00:00:24,330 --> 00:00:26,408
On pages we didn't pick:

11
00:00:26,458 --> 00:00:30,576
3.2 percent wrong, against 8.4 for one AI call.

12
00:00:31,030 --> 00:00:36,397
It guesses before you choose, and shows when it was wrong.

13
00:00:36,860 --> 00:00:37,684
Underneath:

14
00:00:37,734 --> 00:00:45,791
a base Gemini designed, a gate on every field, and a Managed Agent that goes back to the source, live.

15
00:00:46,260 --> 00:00:50,029
Go somewhere real, and a keepsake arrives.

16
00:00:50,079 --> 00:00:53,756
It opens new rooms and meets other Gemis.

17
00:00:54,230 --> 00:00:55,054
Gemiverse.

18
00:00:55,104 --> 00:00:57,328
Build a universe together.
